# Robotaxi Escape through Clarion Alley, which is not a street: you ride it east from Valencia (the
# rider-line autopilot) with a kickflip on the way, and stop at its Mission Street end. The robotaxi
# cannot follow: it goes round by 17th and Mission (the squeezed Mission ends at the alley, so 18th is
# gone) and waits at the alley's mouth, about 15 m from you, never within 3 m. Survived 90 s: the
# kickflip's 100 points and the 500 survival bonus.
park sf
spawn clarion_alley
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 run escape
bot line clarion_alley_line 6
hold ollie 400..420
tap flip+left 426
run 11000
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip,points=100} within 535..535
expect event escapeClose{dist=15} within 5597..5597   # 5596 and 14.99 on the city build before the plazas came back; 4225 and 14.98 before the terraced walls moved the Guerrero gutter; 8622 and 14.99 before the squeezed city, round by 18th St; 8624 before the park carve, 8566 before curb hops (ground.curbHop), 14.98 before city phase 10 moved the streets by cm, 14.97 before phase 11, 14.96 before its second export change
expect event escapeOver{survived=true,score=600,bonus=500} within 10801..10801
expect event escapeOver count == 1
expect car.pos.x > 145 at end
expect car.car.speed == 0 at end
expect session.escapeNear == 0 at end
expect min car.gap > 6 over 1..10800
